{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s going on?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lately, you haven\u2019t been sleeping well. Horrific nightmares and hallucinations haunt you, and you write them down in your notebook. It seems like Vanya is avoiding you\u2026 But is that really the case?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654050/extras/Veles_Scary.png?t=1744318930\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s interesting?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll not only perform your usual cashier duties, but also interact with townspeople, search for answers, solve puzzles, and open doors hiding terrifying secrets. Every action you take influences the story and determines its ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654050/extras/2.png?t=1744318930\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Store Promotions (meme)!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features various unexpected scenes and interactive objects! Every corner of this dark and mysterious world hides something unique \u2014 from strange items that can affect events to unexpected encounters with bizarre characters whose intentions are not always clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654050/extras/+\u0410\u043a\u0446\u0438\u04382.png?t=1744318930\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Can you figure out what\u2019s happening and make it out alive and unharmed?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I don\u2019t know. Good luck.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654050?t=1744318930","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654050/01ac31e0e79195f7d6d31ea67967040459e89483/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744318930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654050/7effb47ac414696ece225952c4a2a45309bc3196/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744318930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654050/7effb47ac414696ece225952c4a2a45309bc3196/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744318930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s going on?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lately, you haven\u2019t been sleeping well. Horrific nightmares and hallucinations haunt you, and you write them down in your notebook. It seems like Vanya is avoiding you\u2026 But is that really the case?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654050/extras/Veles_Scary.png?t=1744318930\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s interesting?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll not only perform your usual cashier duties, but also interact with townspeople, search for answers, solve puzzles, and open doors hiding terrifying secrets. Every action you take influences the story and determines its ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654050/extras/2.png?t=1744318930\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Store Promotions (meme)!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features various unexpected scenes and interactive objects! Every corner of this dark and mysterious world hides something unique \u2014 from strange items that can affect events to unexpected encounters with bizarre characters whose intentions are not always clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654050/extras/+\u0410\u043a\u0